Z||000011||Cliff Pennock||07-25-2001||07:59 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Black88GT:<BR><B>Cliff didn't take to well to my "t-top nazi" comments, I don't think he will like this one too much....</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's correct. Call me over-sensitive but I really do not appreciate stuff like this. Why? Because it gives me the feeling people are unaware of the tremendous horrors hitler brought upon this world. If you think that Bush is "just as bad" as hitler, or a vendor who overprices their items is a "nazi", then in my opinion you are showing enormous disrespect to the millions of people who suffered and died under hitler's reign.<P>What happened in World War II should never become a source for humor.||||reg||1
Z||000012||JSocha||07-25-2001||09:37 AM||||My father is originally from Germany and grew up during WWII and while Hitler was in power.<P>There are the stories we have been told in general in school and on documentaries about the autrocities committed during Hitlers reign, however, sit down with my father and let him tell you the stories first hand that no one has ever been told.  Make your hair stand on end and sick to your stomach.<P>Yes, it is no joking matter.  No war ever is nor any psycotic leader of a country.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000013||fierobaby||07-25-2001||09:43 AM||||as usual I must share my opinion I understand what 8Ball was doing but I do not agree with it... its funny in a way but I think we all need to forget the horrible things that hitler did to everyone. We were shown a video in school last year it was extreamly graphic with real footage from the US ARMY videos they showed the mass graves and all kinds of other things. The thought that one person could do that to so many is really scary. I hope it never happens again||||reg||10
Z||000014||Voytek||07-25-2001||12:21 PM||||Ok.  I couldn't refuse this one.  The photo editing IS funny - no matter what anyone says in here (if you think it's not, you need to go out and get a sense of humor).  Oh, and I AM a Bush fan (even though I'm no Yankee).<BR>Secondly, the Holocaust ended 56 years ago - get over it people.  None of us want it to happen again (too many people from a lot of countries have suffered) but I really don't think bringing up Hitler and the Nazis should offend anyone - it's called history.  Does Stalin and the Bolsheviks offend you?  Well, I think they should.  After all, they killed more people BEFORE WW2 than the Germans did DURING WW2.  Do the British offend you?  Well the British were the inventors of concentration camps during their 'colonization'.  My point is, this is all history and the word has 2 meanings: 1. It happened a long time ago - get over it. 2. Feel free to talk about subjects that interest you.<P>Shaun41178 - I understand YOUR humor (even though half the people missed it). Good one.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000015||Shaun41178||07-25-2001||04:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierobaby:<BR><B>as usual I must share my opinion I understand what 8Ball was doing but I do not agree with it... its funny in a way but I think we all need to forget the horrible things that hitler did to everyone. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Yes we should all forget what happened that way we can repeat it again.  Forget history and you are destined to repeat it.<P>Yes I found the photo funny as well.  And thank you Voytek for understanding my humor.  At least one person got it.  And also thanks for pointing out Stalin and all his crimes.  Don't forget about the Muslims since Christianity killed many long ago during the Holy wars.  So no Muslim jokes in here please  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Yes it was a long time ago.  If making light of horible things that happened long ago keeps you from believing in the same ideals or acting in the same way then the point has been served in a positive way.<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000016||KnightRyder31||07-25-2001||05:04 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Shaun41178:<BR><B> <BR>Yes we should all forget what happened that way we can repeat it again.  Forget history and you are destined to repeat it.<P>Yes I found the photo funny as well.  And thank you Voytek for understanding my humor.  At least one person got it.  And also thanks for pointing out Stalin and all his crimes.  Don't forget about the Muslims since Christianity killed many long ago during the Holy wars.  So no Muslim jokes in here please   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Yes it was a long time ago.  If making light of horible things that happened long ago keeps you from believing in the same ideals or acting in the same way then the point has been served in a positive way.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>My thoughts exactly... and I did get your humor.<BR>BTW- I'm also a Bush fan... I voted for him.<P>||||reg||1
