Z||000018||Patrick's Dad||07-26-2001||10:28 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Actually; President Bush Sr. was rumored to be involved in KKK activity years ago. How ironic.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes, imagine the ironies. I was quite amused when it was discovered that the FBI had found thousands of lost papers related to the McVeigh investigation, and who above all should criticize them? The Honorable (insert choking sound here) Sen. Clinton.<P>And where was Patricia Ireland (Head of NOW, not the cute swimsuit girl) when her mhusband was fooling around with a twenty year old?<P>I agree that those who fail to learn from history are doomed to repeat it. Unfortuantely, there are too many people who are "learning" and thinking about where Hitler "went wrong," and trying to "correct his mistakes." I fear that we are in for worse. Maybe not soon, but eventually. we already have plenty of revisionist history going on in this country.<P>It also hasn't been mentioned that Christians today are being tortured and killed in China, The Sudan, and Nigeria, among others. Apparently, we can safely turn our eyes from these truths.... Isn't this how it began sixty years ago?||||reg||1
