Z||000020||Voytek||07-26-2001||02:13 PM||||Fierochic88 - like I and a couple of other people said on here, nothing wrong about remembering the Holocaust BUT if we DO, we should also talk about all the other attrocities committed in the past and present.  While the media reminds us ALL THE TIME about the Holocaust, NO ONE talks about the thousands and thousands of Christians being slaughtered today in the countries mentioned by Patrick's Dad.  It's almost like saying horrible crimes were committed only during Holocaust but never before or after that.  I don't get it.  Well, I do, but it's not a topic for PFF.||||reg||1
Z||000021||Steve Normington||07-26-2001||05:21 PM||||Maybe it is my twisted humor, but I found the photo funny and I appreciate the quality of the photo editing. Maybe it would have been funnier if you used Pat Buchanan as the image. (Of course you wouldn't need to edit the photo then.) Kudos to Cliff for allowing something which he finds offensive to remain. "I disagree with what you are saying, but I will defend to the death your right to say it."||||reg||1
Z||000022||Songman||07-27-2001||09:55 PM||||I too kind of thought the photo was funny and took no offense to it at all...<P>And yes, I voted for Bush.... and I have recently mentioned my fear of the younger generations having no idea what the Holocaust was all about. There are lots of younger people going are yelling Hiel and goosestepping these day with no idea why.<P>I think it is obvious that the photo was done in humor and is just as harmless as the political parodies we see in our daily newspapers. I think there are enough real problems in the world without people having to worry over harmless humor. No one was in any way saying they had any love for the Nazis here. In every post I have ever read on this forum where the word Nazi was used it was used to mean something awful... therefore I think it has been used wisely.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000023||8Ball||07-28-2001||08:29 AM||||I would just like to thank those who saw my humor in the photo. As I have said before in <BR>This thread, It was meant in humor. It was not meant to make light of a horrid time in our past. But I also do not think that we need to "Forget" about the holocaust. Like has been stated in this thread if you forget your history you are doomed to repeat it.<P>But anyway, it was all meant in humor. And to those who found my humor, Thank you and I hope I was able to make you laugh. To those who failed to see my humor and were offended,<BR>Again I am sorry that you were offended.<P>8ball||||reg||1
